@bobbypage I'm not seeing how it's possible to encounter a succeeded pod here, but just as a protection, you can do this:

```go
// set the pod status to failed (unless it was already in a successful terminal phase)
if status.Phase != v1.PodSucceeded {
	status.Phase = v1.PodFailed
}
```
